function renderTable(data,error,type){if(error)return `<p class=error>${error.message}</p>`;if(!data?.length)return `<p class=muted>No records yet.</p>`;const cols=Object.keys(data[0]);return `<div class=table-wrap><table class=table><thead><tr>${cols.filter(c=>c!=="action").map(c=>`<th>${c}</th>`).join("")}${type||data.some(r=>r.action)?"<th>Action</th>":""}</tr></thead><tbody>${data.map(r=>`<tr>${cols.filter(c=>c!=="action").map(c=>`<td>${fmt(r[c])}</td>`).join("")}${type==="transfer"?`<td>${r.status==="DRAFT"?`<button onclick="approveTransfer('${r.id}')">Approve</button>`:r.status==="APPROVED"?`<button onclick="receiveTransfer('${r.id}')">Receive</button>`:""}</td>`:type==="application"?`<td><button onclick="approveMember('${r.id}','${r.tier_id}')">Approve</button> <button onclick="rejectMember('${r.id}')">Reject</button></td>`:r.action?`<td>${r.action}</td>`:""}</tr>`).join("")}</tbody></table></div>`} 
function tablePage(title,data,error,canAdd=false,formFn=null){if(error){$("#content").innerHTML=`<div class=card>${error.message}</div>`;return}$("#content").innerHTML=`<div class=toolbar><h2>${title}</h2>${canAdd?`<button class=primary onclick="${formFn.name}()">+ Add New</button>`:""}<input placeholder="Search..." oninput="filterTable(this.value)"></div>${renderTable(data,error)}`}
function filterTable(q){q=q.toLowerCase();$$(".table tbody tr").forEach(r=>r.style.display=r.innerText.toLowerCase().includes(q)?"":"none")}
function fmt(v){if(v==null)return"";if(typeof v==='boolean')return v?'Yes':'No';if(typeof v==='object')return JSON.stringify(v);return String(v)}
function modal(title,html){$("#content").insertAdjacentHTML("afterbegin",`<div id=modal class=modal><div class=modal-card><div class=modal-head><h2>${title}</h2><button onclick=closeModal()>×</button></div>${html}</div></div>`)}function closeModal(){$("#modal")?.remove()}
